# Becoming tapped by an effect is the event too (CR 701.26a, 614.1), whoever taps it: on turn 2 Bot2's Icy Manipulator taps
# Bot1's face-down creature, cast with Illusionary Mask - instead it is turned face up and becomes tapped, the 0/8 Caelorna,
# Coral Tyrant, tapped once. Bot2's own Mox it taps for mana meanwhile is no creature of the Mask's and is simply tapped.

